    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="0590" n="1176" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p2/pg1176"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890.20/7–2749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister-Counselor of Embassy in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-27T09:00:00+08:00">July 27, 1949—9 a.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Cantel 828. Foreign Office informs me
                    discussions regarding Far East pact still in most preliminary stages and
                    confined still to China, Philippines. I gather practically no progress is being
                    made.</p>
                <pb facs="0591" n="1177" xml:id="pg1177"/>
                <p>Sent Department, repeated Nanking 554, Shanghai 464, Manila 24, Taipei 83, Seoul
                    9.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
